              ],
              "y_range": [
                -1,
                9
              ],
              "marks": []
            }
          },
          {
            "say": "Pick two points on the curve and join them. The slope of that line is the average steepness between them.",
            "caption": "Slope between two points",
            "visual": {
              "kind": "plot2d",
              "expressions": [
                "x^2"
              ],
              "x_range": [
                -3,
                3
              ],
              "y_range": [
                -1,
                9
              ],
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "secant",
                  "x": 1,
                  "x2": 2.5,
                  "color": "blue"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "say": "Now slide the second point toward the first. The line settles into the tangent at x equals one.",
            "write": "\\frac{f(x+h)-f(x)}{h} \\to f'(x)",
            "caption": "Let the gap shrink",
            "visual": {
              "kind": "plot2d",
              "expressions": [
                "x^2"
              ],
              "x_range": [
                -3,
                3
              ],
              "y_range": [
                -1,
                9
              ],
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "secant",
                  "x": 1,
                  "x2": 2.5,
                  "to_x2": 1.02,
                  "color": "blue"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "say": "Slide that tangent along the curve. It tilts more the further out you go: at x equals one the slope is two, at x equals two it is four.",
            "caption": "The slope is always twice $x$",
            "visual": {
              "kind": "plot2d",
              "expressions": [
                "x^2"
              ],
              "x_range": [
                -3,
                3
              ],
              "y_range": [
                -1,
                9
              ],
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "tangent",
                  "x": -2,
                  "to_x": 2,
                  "color": "red"
                },
                {
                  "type": "point",
                  "x": -2,
                  "to_x": 2,
                  "color": "red"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "say": "So the steepness of x squared at any point is two times x. That is the power rule: bring the two down and lower the power by one.",
            "write": "f'(x) = 2x",
            "caption": "Power rule: bring the power down, lower it by one",
